 "lines": [
  {
   "text": "Seventeen with a head full of dreams",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.66,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Sheaves in the field bowing down to me",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.57,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Wore my father's robe in the morning sun",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.68,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Didn't see the anger I'd begun",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.7,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Down in a dry pit under the sky",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.39,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Twenty pieces of silver and a caravan goodbye",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.55,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "A slave in a stranger's house",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.54,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "A prisoner in chains",
   "heard": 4,
   "words": 4,
   "error_s": 0.98,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "But the LORD was with Joseph",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.23,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Through the long and lonely days",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.14,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "You intended evil against me",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 0.54,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "But God intended it for good",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.63,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Every pit and every prison",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 0.61,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Brought me where I stood",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 0.59,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Now I see it from the palace",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.64,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "What I never understood",
   "heard": 4,
   "words": 4,
   "error_s": 0.61,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "You intended evil against me",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 0.52,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "But God intended it for good",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.22,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Pharaoh dreamed of cattle and of seven ears of grain",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 0.58,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Seven years of plenty, then seven years of pain",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.56,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "They called me from the prison to stand before the throne",
   "heard": 11,
   "words": 11,
   "error_s": 0.55,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "And all the land of Egypt was put under my hand alone",
   "heard": 12,
   "words": 12,
   "error_s": 0.62,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Brothers came for bread and bowed down to the ground",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 0.6,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Just like in the dream, the sheaves had all come round",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 11,
   "error_s": 0.57,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "I am Joseph, your brother",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 0.5,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Come closer to me",
   "heard": 4,
   "words": 4,
   "error_s": 0.5,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Do not be distressed",
